function addons(){return pageTop('추가 기능 요금표','필요한 기능만 선택 · 월 추가 구독')+billingTabs()+[...new Set(cfg.catalog.addons.map(x=>x.group))].map(g=>card(g,addonPriceTable(['기능','월 요금','상태'],cfg.catalog.addons.filter(x=>x.group===g).map(x=>[x.name,money(x.price),x.local?'로컬 구현':'준비 중'])))).join('')+card('추가 기능 패키지',addonPriceTable(['패키지','월 요금','포함 기능'],cfg.catalog.packages.map(p=>[p.name,money(p.price),p.includes.map(i=>cfg.catalog.addons.find(x=>x.id===i)?.name).join(', ')])))+card('알림톡·SMS 별도 충전',addonPriceTable(['유형','건수','가격'],cfg.catalog.messages.map(x=>[x.name,x.quantity,money(x.price)])))}

let staffDeskMember='',staffDeskThread='',staffDeskPending=null;
async function teamBrands(){return has('extra_agent')?(await api('/api/agents/list')).agents.filter(x=>x.available&&!x.archived):[]}
function teamFields(m,brands){return label('관리 브랜드',select('team-brand',[['',me.settings.brand+' · 기본'],...brands.map(x=>[x.id,x.settings.brand])],m.agent||''))+label('권한',select('team-role',[['agent','상담 조회·답변·완료'],['viewer','상담 조회 전용']],m.role||'agent'))+'<label><input type="checkbox" id="team-assigned" '+(m.assigned_only===false||m.assigned_only===0?'':'checked')+'> 배정된 상담만 접근 가능</label>'}
async function teamPage(){const people=await api('/api/team'),brands=await teamBrands();return pageTop('직원 관리','사업주와 직원 계정을 분리합니다.')+card('직원 초청',me.public_access?label('직원 이름',input('team-name'))+label('직원 Google 이메일',input('team-email','','email'))+teamFields({},brands)+btn('초청 링크 발급','inviteTeam()','primary')+'<p class="muted">초청받은 이메일로 Google 로그인해야 합니다. 링크는 7일 동안 유효하며 메일은 자동 발송하지 않습니다.</p>':'<p>유료 상담 또는 체험 이용 권한이 필요합니다.</p>')+card('직원 목록',people.map(m=>'<div class="line"><b>'+e(m.name)+'</b><p>'+e(m.email)+' · '+e(brands.find(x=>x.id===m.agent)?.settings.brand||(m.agent?'이전 브랜드':me.settings.brand))+'</p><small>'+e(({active:'활성',pending:'수락 대기',revoked:'회수됨'})[m.state])+' · '+e(m.role==='viewer'?'조회 전용':'상담 직원')+' · '+e(m.assigned_only?'배정 상담만':'브랜드 전체 상담')+'</small><div class="row">'+(m.state==='active'?btn('권한 변경',"editTeam('"+m.id+"')"):'')+(m.state!=='revoked'?btn('권한 회수',"revokeTeam('"+m.id+"')"):'')+'</div></div>').join('')||'<p class="muted">등록된 직원이 없습니다.</p>')}
function teamPayload(){return {agent:val('team-brand'),role:val('team-role'),assigned_only:checked('team-assigned')}}
async function inviteTeam(){await act(async()=>{const r=await api('/api/team/invite',{...teamPayload(),name:val('team-name'),email:val('team-email')});modal('직원 초청 링크',label('복사해서 전달하세요',input('team-code',location.origin+r.accept_path))+btn('링크 복사',"act(async()=>{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(val('team-code'));toast('복사했습니다.')})",'primary'));await render()})}
async function editTeam(id){await act(async()=>{const m=(await api('/api/team')).find(x=>x.id===id),brands=await teamBrands();if(!m)throw Error('직원 없음');modal('직원 권한 설정',teamFields(m,brands)+btn('저장',"saveTeamPermissions('"+id+"')",'primary'))})}
async function saveTeamPermissions(id){await act(async()=>{await api('/api/team/'+enc(id)+'/permissions',teamPayload());$('.modal')?.remove();render()})}
async function revokeTeam(id){if(!confirm('이 직원의 업체 상담 접근 권한을 회수할까요?'))return;await act(async()=>{await api('/api/team/'+enc(id)+'/revoke',{});render()})}
async function assignTeamMember(){const tid=threadId;await act(async()=>{const r=await api('/api/team/threads/'+enc(tid));modal('직원 계정 배정',label('실제 담당 직원',select('team-member',[['','미배정'],...r.people.map(m=>[m.id,m.name+(m.role==='viewer'?' · 조회 전용':'')])],r.member))+btn('배정 저장',"saveTeamAssignment('"+tid+"')",'primary'))})}
async function saveTeamAssignment(tid){await act(async()=>{await api('/api/team/threads/'+enc(tid),{member:val('team-member')});$('.modal')?.remove();toast('직원 계정 배정을 저장했습니다.');render()})}
async function staffDesk(){const invite=sessionStorage.getItem('csai-staff-invite'),members=await api('/api/staff/memberships');if(!members.some(m=>m.id===staffDeskMember)){staffDeskMember=members[0]?.id||'';staffDeskThread='';staffDeskPending=null}let html=pageTop('직원 상담함','허용된 업체·브랜드 및 배정 상담만 표시합니다.')+(invite?card('직원 초청 수락','<p>초청받은 Google 이메일로 로그인했는지 확인하세요.</p>'+btn('초청 수락','acceptStaffInvite()','primary')+btn('취소',"sessionStorage.removeItem('csai-staff-invite');render()")):'');if(!members.length)return html+card('연결된 업체','<p>사업주에게 초청 링크를 받아 연결하세요.</p>');const m=members.find(x=>x.id===staffDeskMember),path='/api/staff/'+enc(m.id)+'/threads',threads=await api(path);if(!threads.some(t=>t.id===staffDeskThread)){staffDeskThread='';staffDeskPending=null}const t=staffDeskThread?await api(path+'/'+enc(staffDeskThread)):null;return html+card('근무 브랜드',select('staff-membership',members.map(x=>[x.id,x.brand+' · '+x.name]),m.id).replace('<select','<select onchange="switchStaffMembership(this.value)"')+'<p class="muted">'+e(m.role==='viewer'?'조회 전용':'상담 직원')+' · '+e(m.assigned_only?'배정 상담만':'브랜드 전체 상담')+'</p>'+btn('새로고침','render()'))+card('상담 목록',threads.map(x=>'<div class="line"><small>'+e(states[x.status]||x.status)+' · '+e(x.kind)+'</small><p>'+e(x.last||'새 상담')+'</p>'+btn('열기',"openStaffThread('"+x.id+"')")+'</div>').join('')||'<p>조회할 상담이 없습니다.</p>')+(t?card('상담 상세',t.messages.map(x=>photoBubble(x,'staff',t.id,m.id)).join('')+(t.can_reply?label('직접 답변',ta('staff-desk-reply'))+btn('답변 전송',"staffDeskWrite('reply')",'primary') +btn('완료 처리',"staffDeskWrite('resolve')")+(t.photos?btn('사진 첨부',"photoUploadModal('staff')"):'')+(t.files?btn('영상·파일 첨부',"photoUploadModal('staff','file')"):''):'<p class="muted">조회 전용이거나 외부 채널 상담입니다.</p>')):'')}
function switchStaffMembership(id){staffDeskMember=id;staffDeskThread='';staffDeskPending=null;render()}
function openStaffThread(id){staffDeskThread=id;staffDeskPending=null;render()}
async function acceptStaffInvite(){await act(async()=>{const code=sessionStorage.getItem('csai-staff-invite');if(!code)throw Error('초청 링크 없음');const r=await api('/api/staff/accept',{code});sessionStorage.removeItem('csai-staff-invite');staffDeskMember=r.id;toast('직원으로 연결되었습니다.');render()})}
async function staffDeskWrite(action){const mid=staffDeskMember,tid=staffDeskThread,reply=action==='reply'?val('staff-desk-reply').trim():'';if(action==='reply'&&!reply)return toast('답변을 입력하세요.');if(!confirm(action==='reply'?'고객에게 답변을 전송할까요?':'상담을 완료 처리할까요?'))return;const key=JSON.stringify([mid,tid,action,reply]);if(staffDeskPending?.key!==key)staffDeskPending={key,client:crypto.randomUUID()};const client=staffDeskPending.client;await act(async()=>{await api('/api/staff/'+enc(mid)+'/threads/'+enc(tid),{action,reply,client});if(staffDeskPending?.client===client)staffDeskPending=null;toast('처리 완료');render()})}


let businessAgent='',commerceAgent='',commerceCustomerClient=null,commerceCustomerBusy=false;
const commerceChannels={smartstore:'네이버 스마트스토어',coupang:'쿠팡',cafe24:'카페24',imweb:'아임웹',shopify:'Shopify','11st':'11번가',gmarket:'G마켓',auction:'옥션',own:'자사몰',other:'기타'};
const commerceOrderStates={received:'신규 주문',preparing:'배송 준비',shipped:'배송 중',delivered:'배송 완료',cancelled:'취소'};
const commerceRequestKinds={delivery:'배송 문의',exchange:'교환 요청',return:'반품 요청',refund:'환불 요청',defect:'불량 접수',restock:'재입고 희망',other:'기타 문의'};
const commerceRequestStates={pending:'접수',review:'확인 중',resolved:'처리 완료',rejected:'반려'};
function scopeOptions(brands){return [['',me.settings.brand+' · 기본'],...brands.map(a=>[a.id,a.settings.brand])]}
function scopedUrl(path,agent){return path+'?agent='+enc(agent)}
function metric(n,v){return card(n,'<strong style="font-size:24px">'+e(String(v))+'</strong>')}
function dashboardJump(p){if(p==='calendar'){calendarAgent=businessAgent;selectedDate=null;calendarRange=null;}if(p==='inbox'){inboxAgent=businessAgent;threadId=null;}if(p==='customers')crmAgent=businessAgent;if(p==='commerce')commerceAgent=businessAgent;go(p)}
async function businessDashboard(){let brands=has('extra_agent')?(await api('/api/agents/list')).agents.filter(x=>x.available):[];if(businessAgent&&!brands.some(x=>x.id===businessAgent))businessAgent='';const r=await api(scopedUrl('/api/business-dashboard',businessAgent));let metrics=metric('오늘 신규 상담',r.new_threads)+metric('직접 상담 대기',r.manual_pending);if(r.calendar)metrics+=metric('오늘 예약',r.calendar.today)+metric('예약 승인·변경 대기',r.calendar.pending+r.calendar.changes);if(r.work)metrics+=metric('미처리 업무',Object.values(r.work).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0));if(r.contacts!==null)metrics+=metric('등록 고객',r.contacts);if(r.leads!==null)metrics+=metric('관심·구매 의사 고객',r.leads);if(r.sales)metrics+=metric('오늘 등록 주문',r.sales.orders_today)+metric('배송 준비',r.sales.preparing)+metric('판매 문의 대기',r.sales.pending_requests)+metric('오늘 등록 주문금액',money(r.sales.recorded_amount));return pageTop('오늘의 사업 현황',r.date+' · '+r.timezone)+brandSelect('business-brand',brands,businessAgent,'businessAgent=this.value;render()')+'<div class="grid">'+metrics+'</div>'+card('오늘 예약 일정',r.calendar?(r.calendar.records.map(x=>'<div class="line"><b>'+e(new Intl.DateTimeFormat('ko-KR',{timeZone:r.timezone,hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:false}).format(new Date(x.start)))+'</b> · '+e(states[x.status]||x.status)+'</div>').join('')||'<p>오늘 등록된 일정이 없습니다.</p>')+btn('일정표 보기',"dashboardJump('calendar')"):'<p>예약 기능을 사용하면 상담에서 접수된 일정이 표시됩니다.</p>'+btn('일정표 보기',"dashboardJump('calendar')"))+card('운영 바로가기',btn('통합 상담함',"dashboardJump('inbox')",'primary')+btn('고객·업무',"dashboardJump('customers')")+btn('판매 관리',"dashboardJump('commerce')") +btn('직원 관리',"go('team')")+btn('채팅 첨부 설정','photoSettingsModal()')+(r.sales?'<p class="muted">판매 금액은 직접 등록한 주문의 합계이며 결제·정산 매출이 아닙니다.</p>':''))}
function commercePath(path=''){return scopedUrl('/api/commerce'+path,commerceAgent)}
async function commercePage(){if(!me.public_access)return pageTop('온라인 판매 관리','상품·주문·판매 요청을 관리합니다.')+card('판매 관리','<p>유료 상담 또는 체험 계정에서 사용할 수 있습니다.</p>');let brands=has('extra_agent')?(await api('/api/agents/list')).agents.filter(x=>x.available):[];if(commerceAgent&&!brands.some(x=>x.id===commerceAgent))commerceAgent='';let archived=brands.some(x=>x.id===commerceAgent&&x.archived),r=await api(commercePath());let intro=pageTop('온라인 판매 관리','판매처별 주문과 고객 문의를 한 곳에 기록합니다.')+brandSelect('commerce-brand',brands,commerceAgent,'commerceAgent=this.value;render()')+card('판매 관리 설정','<p class="muted">현재 수동 등록 방식입니다. 스마트스토어·쿠팡·자사몰과 실시간 주문·재고·배송 연동은 준비 중입니다. 실제 결제 및 환불은 판매처에서 처리하세요.</p>'+(archived?'<p>보관된 브랜드 · 조회만 가능</p>':btn(r.enabled?'판매 관리 끄기':'판매 관리 활성화',"toggleCommerce("+(!r.enabled)+")",'primary')));let edit=r.enabled&&!archived;return intro+card('상품·옵션·재고',(edit?btn('상품 등록','editCommerceProduct()','primary'):'')+r.products.map(x=>'<div class="line"><b>'+e(x.name)+' · '+e(x.variant||'기본')+'</b><p>'+e(x.sku)+' · '+money(x.price)+' · 수동 재고 '+e(x.stock)+'개 · '+(x.published?'공개':'비공개')+'</p>'+(edit?btn('수정',"editCommerceProduct('"+x.id+"')"):'')+'</div>').join(''))+card('주문 및 배송',(edit?btn('주문 등록','editCommerceOrder()','primary'):'')+r.orders.map(x=>'<div class="line"><b>'+e(commerceChannels[x.channel])+' · '+e(x.reference)+'</b><p>'+e(x.product)+' × '+e(x.quantity)+' · '+money(x.amount)+' · '+e(commerceOrderStates[x.state])+'</p><small>'+e([x.carrier,x.tracking].filter(Boolean).join(' '))+'</small>'+(edit?btn('수정',"editCommerceOrder('"+x.id+"')"):'')+'</div>').join(''))+card('교환·반품·환불·배송 문의',r.requests.map(x=>'<div class="line"><b>'+e(commerceRequestKinds[x.kind])+' · '+e(commerceChannels[x.channel])+'</b><p>'+e(x.reference)+' · '+e(x.details)+'</p><small>'+e(commerceRequestStates[x.state])+'</small>'+btn('상담 열기',"openCommerceThread('"+x.thread+"')")+(edit?select('commerce-request-'+x.id,Object.entries(commerceRequestStates),x.state)+btn('처리 상태 저장',"saveCommerceRequest('"+x.id+"')"):'')+'</div>').join('')||'<p>접수된 요청이 없습니다.</p>')}
async function toggleCommerce(enabled){await act(async()=>{await api(commercePath('/settings'),{enabled});render()})}
function openCommerceThread(id){inboxAgent=commerceAgent;threadId=id;go('inbox')}
async function editCommerceProduct(id=''){await act(async()=>{let r=await api(commercePath()),x=r.products.find(z=>z.id===id)||{};if(id&&!x.id)throw Error('상품 없음');modal('상품 등록·수정',label('SKU (상품·옵션별 고유 코드)',input('cp-sku',x.sku))+label('상품명',input('cp-name',x.name))+label('옵션',input('cp-variant',x.variant))+label('원화 가격',input('cp-price',x.price??0,'number'))+label('수동 재고',input('cp-stock',x.stock??0,'number'))+label('HTTPS 판매 링크',input('cp-url',x.url))+label('고객에게 공개할 상품 설명',ta('cp-description',x.description))+'<label><input type="checkbox" id="cp-published" '+(x.published?'checked':'')+'> 고객 상품 목록·AI 상담에 공개</label>'+btn('저장',"saveCommerceProduct('"+id+"')",'primary'))})}
async function saveCommerceProduct(id){await act(async()=>{await api(commercePath('/products'),{id,sku:val('cp-sku'),name:val('cp-name'),variant:val('cp-variant'),price:Number(val('cp-price')),stock:Number(val('cp-stock')),url:val('cp-url'),description:val('cp-description'),published:checked('cp-published')});$('.modal')?.remove();render()})}
async function editCommerceOrder(id=''){await act(async()=>{let r=await api(commercePath()),x=r.orders.find(z=>z.id===id)||{};if(id&&!x.id)throw Error('주문 없음');modal('주문 등록·수정',label('판매처',select('co-channel',Object.entries(commerceChannels),x.channel||'smartstore'))+label('판매처 주문번호',input('co-ref',x.reference))+label('상품·옵션',input('co-product',x.product))+label('수량',input('co-qty',x.quantity??1,'number'))+label('주문 총액 (수동 기록)',input('co-amount',x.amount??0,'number'))+label('상태',select('co-state',Object.entries(commerceOrderStates),x.state||'received'))+label('택배사',input('co-carrier',x.carrier))+label('운송장 번호',input('co-tracking',x.tracking))+btn('저장',"saveCommerceOrder('"+id+"')",'primary'))})}
async function saveCommerceOrder(id){await act(async()=>{await api(commercePath('/orders'),{id,channel:val('co-channel'),reference:val('co-ref'),product:val('co-product'),quantity:Number(val('co-qty')),amount:Number(val('co-amount')),state:val('co-state'),carrier:val('co-carrier'),tracking:val('co-tracking')});$('.modal')?.remove();render()})}
async function saveCommerceRequest(id){await act(async()=>{await api(commercePath('/requests/'+enc(id)),{state:val('commerce-request-'+id)},'PATCH');render()})}
